[00:00.935] Father, don't blame us for trying to live
[00:06.731] For trying to love, for wanting more
[00:12.771] Father, don't blame us for trying to bleed
[00:18.189] Like real human beings and nothing more
[00:24.644]
[00:35.181] Why did you dress our pleasure up as greed?
[00:40.132] While you're limiting our love, taking sunlight from the seed?
[00:46.690] Why did you give us hearts we don't understand
[00:51.875] Like an apple in our hand that you'll never let us have?
[00:56.483]
[00:57.802] And I hear you don't like it
[01:00.629] I don't care if you don't
[01:03.129]
[01:04.482] Father, don't blame us for trying to live
[01:10.038] For trying to love, for wanting more
[01:15.922] Father, don't blame us for trying to bleed
[01:21.912] Like real human beings and nothing more
[01:25.975]
[01:38.908] Oh, do you envy how I'm free?
[01:43.499] How the life in me is real, running barefoot through the fields?
[01:50.018] Oh, does it hurt how I don't look at you with fear?
[01:55.507] Do you like to watch me kneel, 'cause the way it makes you feel?
[02:00.481]
[02:01.639] And I hear you don't like it
[02:04.392] I don't care if you don't
[02:05.745]
[02:08.099] Father, don't blame us for trying to live
[02:13.762] For trying to love, for wanting more
[02:19.648] Father, don't blame us for trying to bleed
[02:25.008] Like real human beings and nothing more
[02:29.440]
[02:44.651] You can burn the skin I live in
[02:48.901] But you cannot burn the witch away
